      <activity id="7066a403-aeef-5e5d-93f4-954068803ea2" activityNameId="7dfc1e4d-53a4-52f5-b2bf-aa34882ba6f3" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Biogas purification, to methane, 96 vol-%, pressure swing adsorption</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Biogas purification, to methane, 96 vol-%, pressure swing adsorption
Inventory refers to 1 m3 of methane. Electricity consumption and emissions represent the raw gas compression, H2S removal, gas conditioning and methane enrichment of biogas.  Infrastructure expenditures are included employing generic data for facilities of a chemical plant as approximation.;
UUID: 3b436c80-d1b8-3deb-a396-3db92c790de5
Emissions due to leakage and purification of biogas. Input of energy and auxiliary materials. Biogas input excluded from the dataset.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland. Production occurs at Viessmann in Berlin (DE).
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data provided by factories 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3b436c80-d1b8-3deb-a396-3db92c790de5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
